      "start_plus_years": 30,
      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 50,
      "note": "WHE dates the formal opening to 130 BCE following Zhang Qian's missions; UNESCO notes the network took shape between the 2nd century BCE and 1st century CE and remained active until the 16th century."
